---
// About.astro
---

<section class="w-full py-12 md:py-50 bg-zinc-950 text-slate-300 border-t border-slate-900 overflow-hidden">
  
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 lg:gap-16 items-center md:items-start">
        
        <!-- Parte Izquierda (Imagen y Perfil) - Escala reducida en PC -->
        <div class="w-full md:w-5/12 lg:w-1/4 flex flex-col items-center md:items-start space-y-4">
            <div class="relative group">
                <div class="absolute -inset-1 bg-gradient-to-tr from-amber-600 to-amber-400 rounded-xl blur opacity-10 group-hover:opacity-30 transition duration-1000"></div>
                
                <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900">
                    <!-- Reducción de tamaño de imagen: de w-64 a w-48 en PC -->
                    <img
                        src="/imgs/welcome/perfilSinFondo.png"
                        alt="Andrés"
                        class="w-48 h-60 md:w-full md:h-auto object-cover grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out"
                    />
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="text-center md:text-left">
                <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-white tracking-tighter uppercase italic">
                    Andrés
                </h2>
                <p class="text-amber-400 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mt-1 opacity-80">
                    Fullstack Developer
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Redes Sociales más compactas -->
            <div class="flex gap-3">
                <a href="https://github.com/Andresnana21" target="_blank" class="p-2 bg-slate-900/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800 hover:border-amber-400/50 transition-all duration-300 group">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="group-hover:text-amber-400"><path d="M15 22v-4a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1-3.5c3 0 6-2 6-5.5.08-1.25-.27-2.48-1-3.5.28-1.15.28-2.35 0-3.5 0 0-1 0-3 1.5-2.64-.5-5.36-.5-8 0C6 2 5 2 5 2c-.3 1.15-.3 2.35 0 3.5A5.403 5.403 0 0 0 4 9c0 3.5 3 5.5 6 5.5-.39.49-.68 1.05-.85 1.65-.17.6-.22 1.23-.15 1.85v4"></path><path d="M9 18c-4.51 2-5-2-7-2"></path></svg>
                </a>
                <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/andr%C3%A9s-gonzalo-barrera-cortes-0387bb319/" target="_blank" class="p-2 bg-slate-900/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800 hover:border-amber-400/50 transition-all duration-300 group">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="group-hover:text-amber-400"><path d="M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z"></path><rect width="4" height="12" x="2" y="9"></rect><circle cx="4" cy="4" r="2"></circle></svg>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Parte Derecha (Contenido) - Tipografía más controlada -->
        <div class="w-full md:w-7/12 lg:w-3/4 space-y-6">
            <h2 class="text-amber-400 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] inline-block border-b border-amber-400/20 pb-1">
                Sobre mí
            </h2>

            <div class="space-y-4">
                <!-- Reducción de text-4xl a text-2xl/3xl -->
                <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-slate-100 leading-tight font-bold tracking-tight">
                    Soy un programador apasionado por <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 to-amber-200">aprender nuevas cosas</span> cada día.
                </p>

                <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base lg:text-lg font-light">
                    Me caracteriza una curiosidad insaciable que me impulsa a indagar a detalle cómo funcionan las herramientas que utilizo. Mi enfoque es entender la <span class="text-slate-200">arquitectura detrás del código</span>. 
                </p>
                
                <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base lg:text-lg font-light">
                    Integro activamente la <span class="text-amber-400/90 font-medium">inteligencia artificial</span> en mi flujo de trabajo para maximizar mi productividad, permitiéndome resolver problemas complejos y crear soluciones innovadoras.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Stats más discretos -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-2">
                <div class="p-4 bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl hover:border-amber-400/30 transition-all duration-500">
                    <h4 class="text-amber-400 font-black text-xl tracking-tighter">+1 AÑO</h4>
                    <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest mt-1">Explorando Tech</p>
                </div>
                <div class="p-4 bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl hover:border-amber-400/30 transition-all duration-500">
                    <h4 class="text-amber-400 font-black text-xl tracking-tighter">AI-DRIVEN</h4>
                    <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest mt-1">Productividad</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>